  "chapters": [
    {
      "uid": "seed-125",
      "id": "ch01",
      "title": "序章",
      "groups": [
        {
          "uid": "seed-122",
          "id": "001",
          "title": "段落 001",
          "lines": [
            {
              "uid": "99b11911-c4d6-4077-8592-cbc38b09310c",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-1",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_西园寺雪.进入=0",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "6a141b81-498e-4791-934e-d7f642916572",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-2",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_影山菖蒲.进入=0",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-94",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-3",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_主角",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "你们俩还真是像啊，明明都那么在乎对方，却都不肯说出口。",
                "en": "You two are really alike. You clearly care so much about each other, yet neither of you is willing to say it out loud.",
                "ja": "二人とも本当に似ているね。お互いをこんなに大切に思っているのに、なかなか言い出せないんだから。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-95",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-4",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "谁、谁跟她像了！我只是……只是让她别烦我而已。",
                "en": "W-Who's like her! I just... just pay her to stop bothering me.",
                "ja": "だ、誰が彼女なんかと似てるものか！私はただ…ただ金を払って、私に構わせないようにしているだけよ。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "9b13807d-585a-4909-a985-de0f032be3d9",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-5",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.CG# CG_Test_01",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-96",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-6",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "……",
                "en": "……",
                "ja": "……"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "4070d17f-d9f1-43ce-a7ce-2739acd1023a",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-7",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_西园寺雪.退出=0",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-97",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-8",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_旁白",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "病床上的菖蒲沉默了片刻",
                "en": "Shoubu was silent for a moment.",
                "ja": "菖蒲はしばらく沈黙した。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-98",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-9",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "雪小姐说得对，我只是在执行任务。",
                "en": "Miss Yuki is right. I'm just carrying out a mission.",
                "ja": "雪さんの言う通りです。私はただ任務を遂行しているだけです。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-99",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-10",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_主角",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "菖蒲，你明明为了她连命都不要了，还说什么任务？",
                "en": "Shoubu, you've even risked your life for her, yet you call it a mission?",
                "ja": "菖蒲、あなたは彼女のために命さえ惜しまないのに、よく任務なんて言えるね？"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "411709a5-6d93-4fe9-a942-591fb49a08fe",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-11",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_西园寺雪.进入=0",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "3ec8d515-5041-475e-8031-822fad4d01f1",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-12",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_影山菖蒲.退出=0",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-100",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-13",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_主角",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "雪，你也知道，她不是为了钱才留在你身边的吧？",
                "en": "Yuki, you know too, don't you? She's not staying by your side for the money.",
                "ja": "雪、あなたも分かっているでしょう？彼女はお金のためにあなたのそばにいるわけじゃないって。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-101",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-14",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "……我知道",
                "en": "... I know.",
                "ja": "……分かってる。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-102",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-15",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "可是我不懂。为什么有人愿意为我做到这种地步？",
                "en": "But I don't understand. Why would someone be willing to go this far for me?",
                "ja": "でも、私には分からない。どうして誰かが私のためにここまでしてくれるの？"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "2a9fc64c-e76f-410f-82ce-e1924296768b",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-16",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_西园寺雪.表情=悲伤",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-103",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-17",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "我又没给她什么……",
                "en": "I haven't given her anything...",
                "ja": "私、彼女に何も与えていないのに……"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "f645571e-2e04-471a-b9dd-fe965312b0b7",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-18",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_影山菖蒲.进入=0",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-104",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-19",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "因为……你对我来说，不是“任务”，也不是“恩情”。",
                "en": "Because... to me, you are neither a \"mission\" nor a \"debt of gratitude.\"",
                "ja": "だって…あなたは私にとって、「任務」でも「恩」でもないから。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-105",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-20",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "你是……我选择的家人。",
                "en": "You are... the family I chose.",
                "ja": "あなたは…私が選んだ家族です。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-108",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-21",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_主角",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "看吧，你们早就不是主仆，也不是敌人了。",
                "en": "See? You two are no longer master-servant, nor enemies.",
                "ja": "見ての通り、あなたたちはもう主従でも敵でもない。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "9142ec6c-4db9-4fc5-bcb3-6bb21af12031",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-22",
              "kind": "选项",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [
                "seed-106",
                "seed-107"
              ],
              "note": ""
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "uid": "seed-106",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-22A",
              "text": {
                "zh": "不如……试着一起留下，一起幸福。",
                "en": "How about... trying to stay together, and be happy together?",
                "ja": "いっそ……一緒に残って、一緒に幸せになってみない？"
              },
              "nextId": "seed-109",
              "appearConditions": [],
              "enableConditions": [],
              "results": []
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-107",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_001-22B",
              "text": {
                "zh": "(结束对话)",
                "en": "(End conversation)",
                "ja": "（会話を終了）"
              },
              "nextId": "",
              "appearConditions": [],
              "enableConditions": [],
              "results": []
            }
          ],
          "note": ""
        },
        {
          "uid": "seed-123",
          "id": "002",
          "title": "段落 002",
          "lines": [
            {
              "uid": "57ac8714-53f5-4b56-8745-a3c0839861a7",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-1",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_西园寺雪.表情=害羞",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "c41187af-6620-407d-96c8-7422540cf4f6",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-2",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "背包# Like_西园寺雪+1",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-109",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-3",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "谁、谁要跟你一起幸福啊……我只是暂时没地方去而已。",
                "en": "W-Who wants to be happy with you... I just don't have anywhere else to go for now.",
                "ja": "だ、誰があなたと一緒に幸せになんてなるもんか……ただ一時的に行く場所がないだけよ。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-110",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-4",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_主角",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "好好好，那你就“暂时”住着，等你想走的时候我也不拦你。",
                "en": "Fine, fine. Then you can stay here \"for now.\" When you want to leave, I won't stop you.",
                "ja": "はいはい。じゃあ、その「一時的に」住めばいい。出たいって言うときは止めないから。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-111",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-5",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "……雪小姐，其实我……也不想回那个家了。",
                "en": "...Miss Yuki, actually I... don't want to go back to that home either.",
                "ja": "……雪さん、実は私……あの家にも戻りたくないんです。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "b2b181af-afab-48a8-b3a2-590faba04282",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-6",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_西园寺雪.表情=默认",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-112",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-7",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "菖蒲……你怎么也……你不是一直劝我回去联姻吗？",
                "en": "Shoubu... you too... Weren't you the one always urging me to go back for an arranged marriage?",
                "ja": "菖蒲……あなたまで……いつも私に戻って政略結婚しろって言ってたのはあなたじゃない。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-113",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-8",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "因为那时候我以为，只有那样你才能幸福。现在我明白了……",
                "en": "Because back then I thought that was the only way you could be happy. Now I understand...",
                "ja": "だってあの頃は、それでしかあなたが幸せになれないと思っていたから。今は分かった……"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-114",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-9",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "明白什么？",
                "en": "Understand what?",
                "ja": "何が分かったの？"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "4de65eec-ce5c-4732-be3b-67e44ee8c4bc",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-10",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "",
                "en": "",
                "ja": ""
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "剧情.演出# CHA_影山菖蒲.表情=开心",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-115",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-11",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_影山菖蒲",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "幸福不是别人安排的，是自己选的。就像雪小姐选择逃出来一样。",
                "en": "Happiness isn't something others arrange for you. It's something you choose for yourself. Just like Miss Yuki chose to run away.",
                "ja": "幸せは誰かに与えられるものじゃない。自分で選ぶものだ。雪さんが逃げ出す道を選んだように。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-116",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-12",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_西园寺雪",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "菖蒲……你真的变了。以前你从来不会说这种话。",
                "en": "Shoubu... you've really changed. You never used to say things like that.",
                "ja": "菖蒲……本当に変わったね。昔のあなたはそんなこと言わなかった。"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "seed-117",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-13",
              "kind": "对话",
              "characterId": "CHA_主角",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
                "zh": "那你们俩以后打算怎么办？",
                "en": "So what do you two plan to do from now on?",
                "ja": "じゃあ、二人はこれからどうするつもり？"
              },
              "autoAdvance": false,
              "command": "",
              "optionIds": [],
              "note": ""
            },
            {
              "uid": "4473ba79-c34d-48a8-99da-c8848f6a42de",
              "readableId": "Dia_ch01_002-14",
              "kind": "指令",
              "characterId": "",
              "displayName": "",
              "text": {
